        "candidate_id": "C_eb77bab2c511e4c2_2",
        "edit": "In the sequential always block, change the terminal BCD rollover condition from Q[7:0]==8'b10000000 to Q[7:0]==8'b10011001 so the counter resets after reaching 99 instead of 80, and change the non-blocking assignment Q=Q+1 to Q<=Q+1 to keep the increment consistent with the other sequential assignments.",
